 from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 53% of normal in both January to February and August to September. This year so far, March to April 2026 came in at 233% of normal and June to July 2026 at 72%. Grid 27781 had its driest year in 1953 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
